  "body": "CORNER SITE IN MACLEANS ZONE - SPACIOUS BRICK & TILE FAMILY HOME!\r\n\r\nOffered for the first time in 25 years, this spacious three-bedroom brick and tile home sits proudly on a 672m² corner site in one of East Auckland's most sought-after beachside suburbs.\r\n\r\nWith an impressive 210m² floor area, the home has plenty of space for comfortable family living, plus a double garage and refreshed kitchen. The generous corner site has two street frontages, onto Oliver Road and Dorrington Place, giving the home a sense of space and strong street presence.\r\n\r\nLocation is the standout. The home is listed as in zone for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, Pigeon Mountain School and Bucklands Beach Primary, with Macleans College just over 1km away. Eastern Beach's white sand and palm-lined waterfront is moments from your door. Bucklands Beach, Half Moon Bay Marina and the ferry to the CBD and Waiheke Island are all close by. Highland Park shops, Howick Village and Botany Town Centre are a short drive, and the motorway is about 13 minutes away.\r\n\r\nIt sits first in a quiet cul-de-sac, where the only traffic is the people who live there. Homes in this pocket rarely come to market, with only around 24 sales in Eastern Beach in the past year.\r\n\r\nWith flexible settlement of up to six months available if required, this could be the opportunity you've been waiting for. Don't miss out!\r\n\r\n* 3 Bedrooms \r\n* 2 Bathrooms\r\n* 672m² Freehold Corner Site\r\n* 210m² Floor Area\r\n* Solid Brick & Tile Home\r\n* Double Garage\r\n* Refreshed Kitchen\r\n* North Facing Home\r\n* Two Street Frontages\r\n* Quiet Cul-de-sac Position\r\n* Listed In Zone for Macleans College & Bucklands Beach Intermediate*\r\n* Moments to Eastern Beach & Bucklands Beach\r\n* Close to Half Moon Bay Marina & Ferry\r\n* Walking Distance to Bus Stops, Shops, Schools & Amenities\r\n* First Time Offered in 25 Years\r\n* Flexible Settlement Up to 6 Months\r\n\r\n*Buyers to confirm school zoning with the schools.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer - This property is being sold by negotiation or without a price and therefore a price guide can not be provided. The website may have filtered the property into a price bracket for website functionality purposes. All prospective purchasers shall complete their own due diligence, seek legal and expert advice, and satisfy themselves with respect to information supplied during the marketing of this property, including but not limited to: the floor and land sizes, boundary lines, underground services, along with any scheme plans or consents.",
